  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>You gain Appraise, Knowledge (arcana), Linguistics, and Spellcraft as class skills. You can use your Wisdom modifier in place of your Intelligence modifier when attempting one of the listed skills, chosen when you take this talent.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent a second time, in which case you may use the better of the two ability score modifiers on all of the listed skills.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc82\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
